{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/artistry-one-residences-select-group-dubai-design-district","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1392,"crm_id":"7384","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Artistry One Residences","slug":"artistry-one-residences-select-group-dubai-design-district","display_address":"Dubai Design District (D3)","building_type":["penthouse","apartment"],"completion_year":"2029","developer":"Select Group","price":2300000,"display_price":"2.3M","lattitude":25.190596147416,"longitude":55.304901280434,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Artistry One by Select Group is a landmark residential development rising in the heart of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-design-district/\">Dubai Design District (D3)</a>, where architecture, creativity, and waterfront living meet. This 36-storey tower is designed as a sculptural expression of light, form, and transparency, offering a refined collection of <strong>1, 2 and 3-bedroom residences alongside exclusive 4-bedroom duplex penthouses.</strong></p><p>Artistry One Residences are thoughtfully composed with expansive layouts, floor-to-ceiling glazing, and curated material palettes that enhance both comfort and aesthetics. Overlooking the Dubai Canal, Burj Khalifa skyline, and <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/sheikh-zayed-road/\">Sheikh Zayed Road</a>, the project blends serene private living with the vibrant energy of the creative district. Developed by Select Group, one of Dubai’s most trusted premium developers, Artistry One Residences at Dubai Design District deliver an elevated lifestyle defined by design, wellness, and seamless city connectivity.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-provident