o":{"id":2213,"metaTitle":"Artistry One by Select Group – Luxury Living in Dubai Design District","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Artistry One by Select Group offers freehold apartments in Dubai Design District with premium design, waterfront views, and world-class amenities."},"more_info":[{"id":9430,"answer":"<p>Artistry One is a luxury residential tower developed by Select Group, located in Dubai Design District (D3), overlooking Dubai Canal and close to Downtown Dubai, DIFC, and Business Bay.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is Artistry One and where is it located?"},{"id":9431,"answer":"<p>Artistry One Residences is developed by Select Group, a leading Dubai-based developer with over 20 million sq.ft. of developments and more than 7,000 units delivered across residential, commercial, and hospitality projects.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Who is the developer of Artistry One?"},{"id":9432,"answer":"<p>The project offers 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, as well as a limited collection of 4-bedroom duplex penthouses with private terraces and plunge pools.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What types of units are available at Artistry One?"},{"id":9433,"answer":"<p>Artistry One follows a 50/50 payment plan, with 50% during construction and 50% payable upon handover.&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What is the payment plan for Artistry One Residences?"},{"id":9434,"answer":"<p>Yes, Artistry One is considered a strong investment due to its prime D3 location, limited supply, waterfront views, premium design standards, and high rental demand from professionals and creatives.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"Is Artistry One Residences a good investment?"},{"id":9435,"answer":"<p>Yes, Artistry One offers freehold apartments in Dubai, making it ideal for both local and international investors.</p>","question":"Does Artistry One offer freehold ownership?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll